Tennessee has to feel very good about their offensive line with a rookie like Conklin coming in. He will be a massive presence for them immediately in 2016.
At 6-foot-6 and 308 pounds, Conklin is exactly the kind of piece that the Titans can build their line around. He has an excellent work ethic and his leadership was evident during his career with the Michigan State Spartans. Tennessee is a very young team, but they are bringing in the right kind of players to get themselves back to relevance.
