3. Reduce and manage stress: Easing stress can help your mom.
4. Get informed: There are a lot of myths surrounding radiation and cancer. I��m an educator, so I believe education is important. There are many wonderful resources online – a few are http://www.breastcancer.org/treatment/radiation/myths, http://www.cancer.org/cancer/breastcancer/index and http://www.webmd.com/breast-cancer/radiation-therapy-overview
